                                                "sense_id": "a153ae34-e3ce-3020-955a-1d195ea297f4",
                                                "text": "The ſin of many men Is within you, and thus much I ſuppose\nThat if all committers stood in ranke,\nThey'd make a lane[…] <br<And with their spaces reach from hence to hell."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e9802b6-3118-3611-8e4b-ad7da0cb69b6",
                                        "entry_id": "9778d217-5f37-3dfd-a59a-d0c8b6b315bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who commits a crime; perpetrator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6a62d51-192a-49e1-a9ed-48b2d3c8c543",
                                                "sense_id": "5e9802b6-3118-3611-8e4b-ad7da0cb69b6",
                                                "text": "For some here affirm, that Sin is said to be the Punishment of Sin, because in most sinful Actions, the Committer of them is really a Sufferer in and by the very Sin which he commits"
                                            }
                                        ]
